{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bird Game is an abstract, exploration-based RPG with unique, stylized visuals, bizarre puzzles, and turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808460/extras/Untitled_35.gif?t=1749739664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After an large-scale invasion of  purple-eyed crows, you are tasked with seeking out the Renown Wrestling Fish, who decades ago defeated the leader of the same strange beasts. Discover the absurd events unfolding in the Kafkaesque world of Bird Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808460/extras/Untitled_36.gif?t=1749739664\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over two hours of corvidical fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A detailed and comedic story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based RPG combat with animated graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battles with 30+ different adversaries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactions with unique and memorable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A general lack of color</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808460/extras/Untitled_34.gif?t=1749739664\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808460?t=1749739664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808460/eb84a5ecfbc0794fae7a22665c825b0470144a78/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749739664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/380846